    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4061" root="تلو" body-key="t">
    
      10 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استتلاهُ الشَّىْءَ</span></b>  <i>He,</i> or <i>it, invited him to</i>
<i>follow the thing.</i> (M, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِسْتَتْلَيْتُ فُلَانًا</span> <i>I
made such a one to follow me.</i> (IAar, T.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3- 
And <i>I looked for, expected, awaited,</i> or <i>waited
for, such a one.</i> (IAar, T.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استتلى فُلَانًا</span> also
signifies (tropical:)  <i>He sought,</i> or <i>demanded, of such a one,
the arrow of protection</i> [<i>called</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَلَآء</span>, q. v.]. (TA.)

